Subject: dxgi: outputs answer CheckHardwareCompositionSupport

IDXGIOutput6::CheckHardwareCompositionSupport returned E_NOTIMPL; Paint.NET
asks it for its diagnostics and threw. There is no hardware composition
(the X server composes): the flags are 0.

Gate: test/d2dfx-gate.sh.
---
--- a/dlls/dxgi/output.c
+++ b/dlls/dxgi/output.c
@@ -683,9 +683,14 @@
 static HRESULT STDMETHODCALLTYPE dxgi_output_CheckHardwareCompositionSupport(IDXGIOutput6 *iface,
         UINT *flags)
 {
-    FIXME("iface %p, flags %p stub!\n", iface, flags);
+    TRACE("iface %p, flags %p.\n", iface, flags);
 
-    return E_NOTIMPL;
+    if (!flags)
+        return E_INVALIDARG;
+
+    /* No hardware composition: presents are composed by the X server. */
+    *flags = 0;
+    return S_OK;
 }
 
